              "text": "provocare — \"to bring about, to cause; to provoke\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "La pioggia ha provocato molti incidenti. The rain caused many accidents."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "With bad events it means to cause; with a person, to provoke: non provocarmi!"
            }
          ]
        },
